{"kind":"html","caption":"用后序遍历依次处理节点，并为每个节点计算“能够向父节点延伸的最大单边贡献”。左右贡献若为负数就舍弃；经过当前节点的完整路径可以同时连接左右两边，用它更新全局最大值，但向上传递时只能选择其中较大的一边。示例中处理到节点 20 时得到 15 + 20 + 7 = 42，最终答案为 42。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>二叉树中的最大路径和</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 15px; }\n  body{ padding: 24px; }\n  main{ width: 100%; max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; gap: 20px; }\n  .panel { background: #252526; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 10px; color: #fff; font-size: 22px; }\n  p { margin: 0; line-height: 1.7; }\n  .tree { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 22px; padding: 12px 0; }\n  .level { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: clamp(28px, 10vw, 120px); width: 100%; }\n  .branch { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: clamp(20px, 6vw, 72px); }\n  .node-wrap { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 7px; min-width: 74px; }\n  .node { width: 58px; min-height: 58px; border: 2px solid #666; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: #333; color: #eee; font: 700 17px SFMono-Regular, Monaco, Menlo, monospace; transition: background .35s, border-color .35s, color .35s, box-shadow .35s; }\n  .node.active { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(55,148,255,.18); }\n  .node.done { border-color: #3794ff; color: #3794ff; }\n  .node.best { background: #0e639c; border-color: #ffd866; color: #ffd866; }\n  .node-label { min-height: 38px; text-align: center; color: #9cdcfe; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; }\n  .edges { color: #666; font: 18px SFMono-Regular, Monaco, Menlo, monospace; letter-spacing: clamp(22px, 8vw, 90px); height: 18px; }\n  .status { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; margin-top: 16px; }\n  .card { min-height: 90px; padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #444; border-radius: 8px; background: #2d2d30; }\n  .card span { display: block; margin-bottom: 9px; color: #aaa; font-size: 13px; }\n  .value { color: #fff; font: 700 19px SFMono-Regular, Monaco, Menlo, monospace; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n  .value.accent { color: #3794ff; }\n  .formula { margin-top: 16px; padding: 14px; border-left: 4px solid #3794ff; background: #202b36; line-height: 1.7; }\n  .formula code, .legend code { color: #ce9178; font: 14px SFMono-Regular, Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .progress { height: 6px; border-radius: 6px; background: #3c3c3c; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 18px; }\n  .progress > div { height: 100%; width: 0; background: #3794ff; transition: width .45s; }\n  .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px 22px; line-height: 1.6; }\n  .dot { display: inline-block; width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 7px; background: #0e639c; border: 2px solid #3794ff; }\n  @media (max-width: 650px) {\n    body{ padding: 14px; }\n    .panel { padding: 16px; }\n    .status { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .level { gap: 24px; }\n    .branch { gap: 14px; }\n    .node-wrap { min-width: 62px; }\n    .node { width: 52px; min-height: 52px; }\n  }\n  /* COMPACT */ html,body{font-size:12px!important;line-height:1.45!important}body{padding:8px 10px 10px!important}main{max-width:560px!important;gap:8px!important}.panel{padding:8px 10px!important;border-radius:6px!important;border:1px solid #3c3c3c!important}h1{font-size:14px!important;margin:0 0 4px!important;color:#d4d4d4!important}p{font-size:12px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important}.tree{gap:8px!important;padding:4px 0!important}.node{width:36px!important;min-height:36px!important;font-size:12px!important;border-width:1px!important}.node-label{font-size:10px!important;min-height:auto!important;color:#8d8d8d!important}.status{grid-template-columns:1fr!important;gap:6px!important;margin-top:8px!important}.card{padding:8px 10px!important;min-height:auto!important}.card span{font-size:10px!important}.value{font-size:13px!important}.formula{border-left-width:3px!important;padding:8px 10px!important;margin-top:8px!important;font-size:12px!important}.progress{height:3px!important;margin-top:8px!important}.legend{font-size:11px!important;gap:6px!important}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <h1>后序遍历：先算子树，再处理当前节点</h1>\n    <p>示例：<code>root = [-10,9,20,null,null,15,7]</code>。动画展示每个节点的单边贡献，以及经过当前节点时能形成的完整路径。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"tree\">\n      <div class=\"level\">\n        <div class=\"node-wrap\" data-id=\"n10\"><div class=\"node\">-10</div><div class=\"node-label\">等待处理</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"edges\">╱ ╲</div>\n      <div class=\"level\">\n        <div class=\"node-wrap\" data-id=\"n9\"><div class=\"node\">9</div><div class=\"node-label\">等待处理</div></div>\n        <div class=\"node-wrap\" data-id=\"n20\"><div class=\"node\">20</div><div class=\"node-label\">等待处理</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"level\">\n        <div style=\"min-width:74px\"></div>\n        <div class=\"branch\">\n          <div class=\"node-wrap\" data-id=\"n15\"><div class=\"node\">15</div><div class=\"node-label\">等待处理</div></div>\n          <div class=\"node-wrap\" data-id=\"n7\"><div class=\"node\">7</div><div class=\"node-label\">等待处理</div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"status\">\n      <div class=\"card\"><span>当前节点</span><div class=\"value\" id=\"current\">准备开始</div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><span>经过当前节点的路径</span><div class=\"value\" id=\"through\">—</div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><span>全局最大路径和</span><div class=\"value accent\" id=\"answer\">−∞</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"formula\" id=\"formula\">单边贡献 = 节点值 + max(0, 左贡献, 右贡献)</div>\n    <div class=\"progress\"><div id=\"bar\"></div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel legend\">\n    <span><i class=\"dot\"></i>蓝色：当前处理节点</span>\n    <span><code>完整路径</code>可同时使用左右两边</span>\n    <span><code>向上传递</code>只能选择一边，否则会产生分叉</span>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const steps = [\n    { id:'n9', value:'9', through:'9', answer:'9', contribution:'9', formula:'叶子节点 9：左右贡献均为 0，完整路径 = 9，向上传递 = 9' },\n    { id:'n15', value:'15', through:'15', answer:'15', contribution:'15', formula:'叶子节点 15：完整路径 = 15，向上传递 = 15' },\n    { id:'n7', value:'7', through:'7', answer:'15', contribution:'7', formula:'叶子节点 7：完整路径 = 7，向上传递 = 7；全局最大值仍为 15' },\n    { id:'n20', value:'20', through:'15 + 20 + 7 = 42', answer:'42', contribution:'35', formula:'节点 20：完整路径同时连接左右子树，得到 42；向父节点只能传递 20 + max(15, 7) = 35', best:true },\n    { id:'n10', value:'-10', through:'9 − 10 + 35 = 34', answer:'42', contribution:'25', formula:'根节点 -10：完整路径为 34，未超过 42；向上传递为 -10 + max(9, 35) = 25' },\n    { id:null, value:'遍历完成', through:'最优路径：15 → 20 → 7', answer:'42', contribution:'', formula:'最终答案是 42。最大路径不必经过根节点。', finish:true }\n  ];\n  const wraps = [...document.querySelectorAll('.node-wrap[data-id]')];\n  const current = document.getElementById('current');\n  const through = document.getElementById('through');\n  const answer = document.getElementById('answer');\n  const formula = document.getElementById('formula');\n  const bar = document.getElementById('bar');\n  let index = 0;\n\n  function reset() {\n    wraps.forEach(w => {\n      w.querySelector('.node').className = 'node';\n      w.querySelector('.node-label').textContent = '等待处理';\n    });\n    current.textContent = '准备开始';\n    through.textContent = '—';\n    answer.textContent = '−∞';\n    formula.textContent = '单边贡献 = 节点值 + max(0, 左贡献, 右贡献)';\n    bar.style.width = '0%';\n  }\n\n  function showStep(step, i) {\n    wraps.forEach(w => w.querySelector('.node').classList.remove('active'));\n    if (step.id) {\n      const wrap = document.querySelector(`[data-id=\"${step.id}\"]`);\n      const node = wrap.querySelector('.node');\n      node.classList.add('active');\n      if (step.best) node.classList.add('best');\n      wrap.querySelector('.node-label').textContent = `向上贡献：${step.contribution}`;\n      current.textContent = step.value;\n      setTimeout(() => {\n        node.classList.remove('active');\n        node.classList.add('done');\n        if (step.best) node.classList.add('best');\n      }, 1250);\n    } else {\n      current.textContent = step.value;\n      document.querySelectorAll('[data-id=\"n15\"] .node, [data-id=\"n20\"] .node, [data-id=\"n7\"] .node').forEach(n => n.classList.add('best'));\n    }\n    through.textContent = step.through;\n    answer.textContent = step.answer;\n    formula.textContent = step.formula;\n    bar.style.width = `${((i + 1) / steps.length) * 100}%`;\n  }\n\n  function tick() {\n    if (index === 0) reset();\n    showStep(steps[index], index);\n    index++;\n    if (index >= steps.length) {\n      setTimeout(() => { index = 0; tick(); }, 3000);\n    } else {\n      setTimeout(tick, 2100);\n    }\n  }\n\n  setTimeout(tick, 900);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
